{"4135530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Among Paws", "steam_appid": 4135530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CATS, FISH, AND SUSPICION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among Paws is a cozy 4–8 player social deduction party game where sneaky cats steal fish at night, accuse each other in the morning, and race to become the first 5 kg champion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135530/extras/612f46b77ed86cde24b4ccdd43979d3b.poster.avif?t=1787830636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135530/extras/612f46b77ed86cde24b4ccdd43979d3b.webm?t=1787830636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135530/extras/612f46b77ed86cde24b4ccdd43979d3b.mp4?t=1787830636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every night, one or more cats wake up with a secret plan: steal the fish without getting caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal the fish carefully. The other cats may be sleeping, but every suspicious move can come back to haunt you in the morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HOW IT PLAYS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When morning comes, everyone gathers around the table to discuss, bluff, defend, and accuse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accuse the real thief, and the innocent cats share the fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accuse the wrong cat, and the thief enjoys the feast.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135530/extras/5a77334dab0fe7abae282fc155842c63.poster.avif?t=1787830636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135530/extras/5a77334dab0fe7abae282fc155842c63.webm?t=1787830636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135530/extras/5a77334dab0fe7abae282fc155842c63.mp4?t=1787830636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discuss in the morning<br>Innocent cats search for clues while thieves bluff their way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vote for the suspect<br>The table decides which cat looks the most suspicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STEAL, BLUFF, ACCUSE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal the fish at night<br>Sneaky cats make their move while the others sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bluff your way out<br>If you are the thief, stay calm, act innocent, and convince everyone to blame another cat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the real thief<br>If you are innocent, listen carefully, watch the table, and vote before the thief gets away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135530/extras/67da91041797cf4f6f81d921e0c6cbd0.poster.avif?t=1787830636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135530/extras/67da91041797cf4f6f81d921e0c6cbd0.webm?t=1787830636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135530/extras/67da91041797cf4f6f81d921e0c6cbd0.mp4?t=1787830636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round is short, social, and chaotic. One clever lie or one perfect accusation can change who gets the fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RACE TO 5 KG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every successful round makes the winning cats heavier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winners eat the fish, grow bigger, and get closer to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first cat to reach 5 kg wins the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135530/extras/109cdf7514da8ee50de0b8b6535d6ea7.poster.avif?t=1787830636\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135530/extras/109cdf7514da8ee50de0b8b6535d6ea7.webm?t=1787830636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4135530/extras/109cdf7514da8ee50de0b8b6535d6ea7.mp4?t=1787830636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No eliminations, no waiting<br>Every cat stays in the game, and every round matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you lose a vote, you are never removed from the match. You keep playing, keep accusing, and keep fighting for the next fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WHY PLAY AMONG PAWS?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful twist on social deduction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast rounds built for friend groups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute cats, suspicious behavior, and chaotic accusations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A race-to-5 kg victory goal instead of player elimination</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice and text chat support for bluffing, arguing, and meowing your way to victory</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CATS, FISH, AND SUSPICION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among Paws is a cozy 4–8 player social deduction party game where sneaky cats steal fish at night, accuse each other in the morning, and race to become the first 5 kg champion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai